<!DOCTYPE airframe SYSTEM "../airframe.dtd">
<airframe name="X450">
  <description>
    WLToys X450 Hybrid airframe

    + FC:           Lisa MX v2.1
    + IMU:          Aspirin v2.2
    + MOTORS:       Default Motors of set
    + ACTUATORS:    Default ESCs and servos of set
    + GNSS:         uBlox M10
    + MMAGNETOMETER:IST8310 on GNSS PCB, option to use MPU9250 on FC
    + TELEMETRY:    Hope 868MHz
    + CURRENT:      Powerbrick clone
    + RCRX:         OpenRXSR on SBus port
    + RANGEFINDER:  Via MTF02P Opticflowsensor
    + OPTICFLOW:    MicoAir MTF02P serialbus

  </description>

